<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23067" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γύναιος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναικεῖος, γ. δῶρα</span>
			 presents <i>made to a woman,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.521.15.247
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυὴ γυναίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					2.45
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γύναιον</span></b> , τό, <i>little woman,</i> term of endearment for a
			wife, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				610
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Th.</u>
				792
			</span></i>: more freq. in a contemptuous sense, <i>weak woman,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.130
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναίου πρᾶγυ᾽ ἐποίει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					25.57
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1171b10
			</span></i>: but simply, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνή</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				2.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				17.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				1.12.4
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.99
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pel.</u>
				9
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
